  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study: Education and Youth Empowerment for Chin Communities in Chin State</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This feasibility study aims to prepare the groundwork for an Education and Youth Empowerment Project targeting Chin communities in Chin State. Through surveys, focus group discussions, and workshops with youth, parents, and community leaders, the study will assess the most urgent educational needs, including English, IT, civic education, and vocational training. The process will also include partnership meetings between CCADK and Bawinu Foundation to clarify roles and establish a long-term cooperation framework. The expected outcome is a comprehensive needs assessment, a draft curriculum outline, and a jointly developed project concept that will serve as the basis for the next application stage.</narrative>
  </description>
